*.zip
# model weights live on HF Hub, not in git
models/*
!models/README.md
# raw eval outputs (benchmark questions/answers, agent trajectories) are not redistributed;
# only aggregated summaries (md/csv/json) under results/ are committed
results/**/*.jsonl
results/**/trajectories/
results/**/raw/
*.traj
*.traj.json
# ASI-Bench seed31415 ships reference answers: never commit anything from it
*seed31415*/
**/reference/
# job logs (keep the hand-written worklog)
*.log
*.out
*.err
